<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "4A">
<servcat sctnbr = "04" scnbr = "01">
<configtype typenbr = "0">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A4106018" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Brake Master Cylinder Assembly Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A4106016">Brake Master Cylinder Components</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A4106017">Brake Master Cylinder Assembly On-Vehicle Inspection</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
The brake master cylinder and brake booster will lose their original performance if they are disassembled and reassembled.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If any faulty condition is found in the brake master cylinder or brake booster, replace the part rather than trying to disassemble and repair it.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Brake fluid is extremely damaging to painted surfaces.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If brake fluid contacts painted surfaces, immediately wipe it off and flush the surfaces with water thoroughly.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention4>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A4106018001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Clean external surface of brake master cylinder.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For LHD, disconnect brake fluid level switch connector (1) on reservoir and detach clip (2) from reservoir.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A410020.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "69.059mm" ver = "01" gw = "203" gh = "179"/>
</figure>
<ptxt>
For RHD, disconnect brake fluid level switch connector (1) on reservoir.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A410021.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "70.062mm" ver = "01" gw = "204" gh = "182"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drain brake fluid in reservoir.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For M/T model, disconnect clutch reservoir hose (3) from reservoir.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For LHD, loosen flare nuts with special tool and remove brake pipes (1) from brake master cylinder and ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> hydraulic unit / control module assembly.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
For RHD, loosen flare nuts with special tool and disconnect brake pipes from brake master cylinder.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L4A002">
<s-part>
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09950-78220">
09950–78220
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove brake master cylinder fixing nuts (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A410022.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "135.862mm" ver = "01" gw = "227" gh = "369"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
LHD
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
RHD
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove brake master cylinder (1) and O-ring (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A410023.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.045mm" ver = "01" gw = "223" gh = "140"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A4106018002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A4106020">Brake Master Cylinder Assembly Inspection</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Apply grease included in spare part for brake master cylinder or brake booster to new O-ring (2), and install it to brake master cylinder assembly (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A410023.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.045mm" ver = "01" gw = "223" gh = "140"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install brake master cylinder to brake booster.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten brake master cylinder fixing nuts (2) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T4A004">
<t-part>
Brake master cylinder fixing nut
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
18
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
1.8
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
13.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For LHD, install brake pipes (1) to brake master cylinder and ESP<sup>&#174;</sup> hydraulic unit / control module assembly, and then tighten flare nuts (3) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
For RHD, connect brake pipes to brake master cylinder and tighten flare nuts to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T4A005">
<t-part>
Brake pipe flare nut
</t-part>
<t-part1>
b
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
21
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
2.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
15.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A410024.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "139.742mm" ver = "01" gw = "227" gh = "380"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
LHD
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
RHD
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For M/T model, connect clutch reservoir hose to reservoir. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5306011"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For LHD, connect brake fluid level switch connector and install clip to reservoir.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
For RHD, connect brake fluid level switch connector.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Bleed brake system. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4106004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For M/T model, bleed clutch system. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5306007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check installed parts for brake fluid leakage.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check brake pedal for play. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A4106008"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check that brake system operates properly without fluid leakage.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
